  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 402.72 Used oil",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 402.72 “Used oil” means an oil that, through use or handling, has become unsuitable for its original purpose due to the presence of physical or chemical impurities or loss of original properties.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Or 400) #10393, eff 9-1-13; ss by #12643, eff 10-10-18 (formerly Env-Or 402.60) (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Or 400)",
